      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPEED CHELLER (1) has been in super consistent form recently with seven minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fourth (22.97) at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Can make amends. SOUL SURFER (2) collided with another runner and was out of the placings when a 8 length sixth (23.10) in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Gets chance to atone. SWEET MICHELLE (6) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Dixie Lad (22.75) in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be in this for a long way. MR. REFINED (4) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
